--- the suggested 400 case is covered too ---
  IT-API-015 asserts a non-array `capabilities` is a 400
  (CAPABILITIES_NOT_AN_ARRAY) rather than a silently emptied request.
  IT-API-013 asserts the pinned and unpinned success responses share the
  SAME `negotiation` shape.
  Both stayed green under the mutation above, because that mutation only
  removed the 409 reason and did not touch the 400 guard.

